{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to flag an important issue with the power situation in Lab 3. During a facilities inspection this week, I found that Lab 3's existing circuit is only 20 amps. The robotics equipment requires a dedicated 240-volt circuit, which the current infrastructure does not provide. I confirmed this electrical requirement during the inspection but have not yet added it to the conversion request. This means the existing room infrastructure will NOT support the robotics equipment as the draft request currently assumes -- we'll need an electrical upgrade before the equipment can be delivered."}
