{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you, Ms. Shah, for that update on the network requirements. From a finance perspective, I want to note that the $18,500 grant I disclosed is restricted specifically to capital infrastructure and equipment preparation. The electrical upgrade Mr. Ortiz identified and the wired network drops and secure IoT network Ms. Shah just described would both appear to fall within that restriction, which is promising. However, I should flag two concerns for the group. First, the increase from 12 to 16 workstations may increase the total cost of both the electrical and network upgrades beyond what we initially might have estimated at 12 stations. Second, I have not yet entered this grant into the project ledger, so for the vendor's requirement of a documented funding source, I will need to get it properly recorded before we can provide that documentation. Dr. Morgan, I'd recommend that once Mr. Ortiz and Ms. Shah provide revised cost estimates for the 16-station configuration, we assess whether the $18,500 will fully cover the infrastructure preparation costs, or whether we'll need to identify additional funding."}
